From 13ba6a777a55bd64a3d8edac0d8df69903f491e3 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: vkd3d-crossover <noreply@vkd3d-crossover.invalid>
Date: Tue, 17 Nov 2026 01:12:17 -0500
Subject: [PATCH 09/10] chore(dev): add GPU debug buffer

Problem: Needed values from inside game shaders ("GPU printf").

Root cause: Diagnostics only; no defect.

Fix: MVKDebugBuffer.h: a shared buffer bound at Metal buffer index 20 for fragment and compute pipelines; records are appended to $WINEPREFIX/drive_c/gfx-dbg.bin every 2 s on present (decoder tools/dev/dbgcap/decode.py).

Verified by: Captured ~60 values per pixel in one run, which found the CAS comparator bug (SPIRV-Cross S1).

Off switch: off by default; MVK_DEBUG_BUFFER=1, or automatic with MVK_MSL_OVERRIDE_DIR (MVK_DEBUG_BUFFER=0 disables)
